{"data":{"body":"**[P1] Implement the complete `Span` interface.** Modern `opentelemetry-api` versions define abstract `Span.add_link()`, but this subclass omits it. Because the package allows any version `>=1.20.0`, constructing `DurableParentSpan` can raise `TypeError`, disabling both plugins at invocation start. Add a no-op `add_link()` implementation and test against a current supported OTel release.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOPsIIsM7qjlZx","finding_digest":"7ce2bec4df5784259f0decdbf767bff2fb67085f181a6d47c93d85e841a85e45","finding_id":"arf_v1_ptrl5rg7k6cclhyn5tn7oz576l","finding_key":"otel/durable_parent_span.py::durableparentspan::span-api-completeness","identity_key":"otel/durable_parent_span.py::durableparentspan::span-api-completeness","line":19,"observation_digest":"1f008e109a756d45164c1766e2833c53eb32d0fb796ccb81b23609c586d6efbb","observation_id":"aro_v1_d4ai4ee2ovwukfsmc5tofaz4kp","path":"packages/aws-durable-execution-sdk-python-otel/src/aws_durable_execution_sdk_python_otel/durable_parent_span.py","prior_finding_id":"","published_at":"2026-09-04T14:54:13Z","review_id":"arr_v1_eldnl37r54fgtmmnvotfcviyga","reviewed_base_sha":"f560c4a1c532702196337e61ed897d2586ae7a63","reviewed_head_sha":"178e30c5d97c4ee91c7c1ceedcbe4872a53645e0","reviewer":"codex","start_line":19,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":696},"record_id":"art_v1_yhrcsts2mvfyw3wklqqxphxhei","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-09-04T14:54:13Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-python","id":1052903600},"schema_version":1}
